        "status": "Contact Oleg Drokin (green@whamcloud.com) with any questions on this account"
      },
      "date": "2026-08-30 07:06:18.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 4:\n\n(5 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nSome concerns, see inline comments.\n\nThe approach only narrows the window for the crash in LU-20587 rather than closing it. lnet_peer_ni_show_dump() never checks any nla_nest_start() return, and nla_nest_end() dereferences that pointer unconditionally, so every time the estimate comes up short the dump still oopses. Sizing the skb helps, but the dump handler needs to handle a full skb before the sizing can be relied on.",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
      "_revision_number": 4
    },
